    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d152">

                <pb facs="0295" n="199" xml:id="pg199"/>

                <head>No. 152.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Fish to Sir Edward
                    Thornton.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1872-06-10"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 10,
                        1872</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your note of the 17th ultimo, informing me of the appointment of Captain
                    Cameron, of the royal artillery, as Her Britannic Majesty’s commissioner to
                    survey the northwest boundary, and that Her Majesty’s government would be glad
                    to know the views of this Government in regard to the commencement of the
                    operations, and stating that if it should appear to be expedient, orders would
                    be given to Captain Cameron to proceed to Washington for the purpose of making
                    the necessary arrangements in concert with the commissioner who may be appointed
                    on the part of this Government.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to announce to you, for the information of Her Majesty’s
                    government, that the President has appointed Archibald Campbell, esq.,
                    commissioner on the part of the United States.</p>
                <p>With reference to the points upon which you desire information, I have to inform
                    you that they will receive early attention, and I shall then recur to the
                    subject.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>HAMILTON FISH.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
